; A directive registered via --external-directive in "line" mode is skipped
; instead of causing a parse error.  Only the header line is consumed, and the
; surrounding transactions parse normally.
newdirective experiment tag=cool region=us

2024/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Checking    $100.00
    Equity:Opening

test --external-directive newdirective:line reg
24-Jan-01 Opening               Assets:Checking             $100.00      $100.00
                                Equity:Opening             $-100.00            0
end test
